# Qwen3.8-27B served locally by MTPLX on Apple Silicon.
# ALIAS names the model in opencode and selects the preset section below.
PROVIDER mtplx
ALIAS    qwen3.8-27b
CONTEXT  32768            # --context-window; raise it on a bigger box
PARALLEL 4                # --max-active-requests; the scheduler mode is in the preset
PRESET   ./preset.ini     # `spinloop serve` launches `mtplx serve` from this
# BASEURL http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1   # uncomment for a non-default host/port
# `spinloop cloud` cannot deploy this: mtplx is Apple-Silicon-only and has no
# machine image to run it on a cloud GPU
